==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Unified Minds|Salandit|98}} from the {{TCG|Unified Minds}} expansion; both cards have the Gnaw attack.
*'''Gnaw''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Base Set|Pikachu|58}} from the {{TCG|Base Set}}. 
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

